# Evaluation questions for the synthetic corpus (tests/common/corpus.rs).
# `gold`, `gold_l3` and `stale` hold symbolic keys, not ids: ids are assigned when
# the corpus is seeded. Resolve them with
#   cargo run --example seed_storage -- corpus --questions <this file> <out.jsonl>
# Keys: fact:<scope>:<n>  pair:<n>:current|stale  event:<n>  warm:<n>
